Attribution / 来源说明

Clothesline is a Windows reimplementation of Tendedero, a tiny native macOS app
by Alejandro Buján: https://github.com/alejandrobujan/tendedero

Tendedero's source code is MIT licensed; this project follows the same license
and keeps the original copyright notice above. Clothesline is an independent
implementation: it contains no source code from Tendedero, but deliberately
copies its interaction design and behaviour spec — every good idea here
belongs to the original author.

Tendedero's name and icon are NOT part of the MIT grant. Clothesline therefore
uses a different name and a separately drawn icon, and is not affiliated with,
nor endorsed by, the original author.
